unter [[Lee Roy]], a dangerous [[Organization]] [[Seeker]] who is after Todd's [[Titan]], [[Thunderok]], and will not take no as an answer.","text":"Ford joins the Huntik team on a mission to find Todd, a member of the Monsterok band who has gone missing. As Dante Vale and Ford investigate deeper, they soon encounter Lee Roy, a dangerous Organization Seeker who is after Todd's Titan, Thunderok, and will not take no as an answer."},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"<gallery>\nFile:Comic 15 The Titan's Stage cover.jpg|Full cover art\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Comics| 15]]{{Clear}}{{ComicsNav}}","text":"File:Comic 15 The Titan's Stage cover.jpg|Full cover art"}],"full_text":"The Titan of the Stage is the fifteenth issue of the Huntik Magazine comic book series.\n\n== Synopsis ==\nFord joins the Huntik team on a mission to find Todd, a member of the Monsterok band who has gone missing. As Dante Vale and Ford investigate deeper, they soon encounter Lee Roy, a dangerous Organization Seeker who is after Todd's Titan, Thunderok, and will not take no as an answer.\n\n== Gallery ==\n\nFile:Comic 15 The Titan's Stage cover.jpg|Full cover art","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox comic\n|image = File:HM15 cover.jpeg\n|issue = 15\n|italian title = Il Titano del Palcoscenico\n|previous = [[Cerberus (Comic)|Cerberus]]\n|released = August 2011\n|next = [[The Bulls of Pamplona]]\n|new titans = [[Thunderok]]\n|new characters = [[Lee Roy]] <br> [[Todd]]\n}}\n'''The Titan of the Stage''' is the fifteenth issue of the ''[[Huntik Magazine]]'' comic book series.\n\n== Synopsis ==\n[[Ford]] joins the Huntik team on a mission to find [[Todd]], a member of the Monsterok band who has gone missing. As [[Dante Vale]] and Ford investigate deeper, they soon encounter [[Lee Roy]], a dangerous [[Organization]] [[Seeker]] who is after Todd's [[Titan]], [[Thunderok]], and will not take no as an answer.\n\n== Gallery ==\n<gallery>\nFile:Comic 15 The Titan's Stage cover.jpg|Full cover art\n</gallery>\n[[Cat